---
description: Shared project-wide engineering rules for all Cursor tasks
alwaysApply: true
---

Read the root `AGENTS.md` before editing. It is the canonical project instruction file.

- Inspect the existing architecture and working tree first.
- Keep changes focused and consistent with existing conventions.
- Use relevant skills from `.agents/skills/`.
- Coordinate parallel work by assigning exclusive file ownership.
- Add or update tests for behavior changes.
- Run relevant checks and report exact results; never invent successful verification.
- Protect secrets and avoid destructive operations without approval.
